    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not my content though. i've literally looked at the rules and i'm not breaking anything. it's like the algorithm \"predicts\" i'm going to disrupt the status quo or something? it's like there's this invisible barrier. i've even tried being super quiet and just observing, but even then, the engagement in the channels i'm in drops off. it happens in every single place. if it's not me, then it has to be something external controlling the flow of people. don't you think it's weird that a system designed to maximize engagement would do the exact opposite the second i show up?",
